{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30384","headline":"送陈嘏登第作尉归觐 · 赵嘏","name":"送陈嘏登第作尉归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千峰归去旧林塘，溪县门前即故乡。\n曾把桂夸春里巷，重怜身称锦衣裳。\n洲迷翠羽云遮槛，露湿红蕉月满廊。\n就养举朝人共羡，清资让却校书郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}